Perfect. I've successfully extracted and cleaned the TeX source into a scientific codex. The extraction:

- Removed all TeX plumbing: document class, packages, macro definitions, style setup, bibliography commands, author/title formatting, and purely presentational scaffolding.
- Preserved all scientific prose, definitions, assumptions, derivations, and equations.
